  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Village is Irish Aid&#x2019;s strategic partner at primary school education level. It aims to embed GCE in primary education policy and curriculum while building the capacity and confidence of teachers and school leaders to embed GCE in their teaching and all aspects of school life. Key activities include professional development provided for teachers and school leaders in GCE, supporting GCE practitioners to deliver quality GCE in primary education, engaging with and influencing national and international policy and curriculum changes in the primary education sector and increasing visibility for the programme and GCE within the primary education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
